# An example written from a description: "shoot from cover, give ground before a charge,
# come back when it stops."
drill "Fabian Screen"
about "Shoot from cover, give ground before a charge, come back when it stops."
type Marksman
dials aggression 0.10 discipline 0.30 cohesion 0.10 cover 1.00 patience 0.50 nerve 0.60

sergeant:
  when enemy charging and enemy within 30  -> fall back 20; set phase giving
  when phase is giving and enemy beyond 30 for 6s -> advance; set phase screen
  when losing the exchange                 -> find cover; fire at will
  when no harm for 20s                     -> advance
  otherwise                                -> form skirmish; fire at will

man:
  when enemy charging and enemy within 20  -> fire; back 10
  # never fire through your own smoke: step out of it first, upwind if you can
  when in smoke and enemy beyond 20        -> step out of the smoke
  when in cover and loaded and enemy within 70 -> fire
  when not in cover                        -> take cover within 12
  otherwise                                -> reload kneeling
